<title>HONG KONG: Nam Pei Hong postponed interim results.</title>
<headline>Nam Pei Hong postponed interim results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chinese medicine retailer Nam Pei Hong (Holdings) Ltd said on Monday it had postoned the board meeting to approve the company interim results to January 6 from the initial December 30.</p>
<p>The company gave no further details.</p>
<p>The interim results is for six months months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
